## 5️⃣ pyproject.toml (MOST IMPORTANT)

### 📄 `pyproject.toml`
```toml
[build-system]
requires = ["setuptools>=61.0"]
build-backend = "setuptools.build_meta"

[project]
name = "tamanna-system"
version = "1.0.0"
description = "Tamanna System Automation Package"
readme = "README.md"
requires-python = ">=3.8"
license = {text = "MIT"}

dependencies = [
    "requests",
    "tqdm",
    "google-api-python-client",
    "google-auth",
    "google-auth-httplib2",
    "google-auth-oauthlib"
]

[project.urls]
Homepage = "https://example.com"